==Points of Interest==

=== Pokémon Day Care===
The Pokémon Day Care can be accessed once the player has obtained HM01 and the Cascade Badge.

In the back room is the Nursery where one of the staff will give the player a Togepi egg. Afterwards, she will offer a choice of 3 other eggs in exchange for certain items, 3 times. First for 5 Pretty Wings, she will give a choice of a blue egg containing an Azurill, a yellow egg with a Pichu, or a pink egg that has either a Cleffa or an Igglybuff. Second for 1 Heart Scale she will give a brown egg containing a Bonsly, a blue egg with a Mantyke or a pink egg that has a Happiny. Finally for 1 Honey she will give a yellow egg containing an Elekid, a red egg containing a Magby, or a pink egg that has a Smoochum.

===Tunnel===
A [[Underground Paths|tunnel]] that goes under [[Saffron City]] links Route 5 and [[Route 6]].

